Package: mintstatlab
Version: 1.0.0
Section: math
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Sam <sam@local>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, python3-numpy, python3-scipy, python3-matplotlib, python3-psutil
Description: Linux Mint System Statistical Telemetry & Anomaly Lab
 MintStatLab is a native GTK3 statistical computing and telemetry workbench
 for Linux Mint. It analyzes live operating system resources through
 heavy-tail probability distributions (Log-Normal, Pareto), Lorenz inequality
 curves and Gini coefficients, non-parametric Kaplan-Meier process survival
 dynamics, Poisson Point Process log arrival modeling, and OLS memory leak drift regression.
